        "mission_intent": "Subject: Assessment of IT General Controls Alignment with COSO Framework\n\nHi team, as part of our annual internal control evaluation ahead of the external audit cycle, I need you to perform a comprehensive review of our IT general controls environment across all major financial reporting systems \u2014 specifically SAP, Workday Financials, and the Hyperion consolidation platform. The review should assess whether our technology-related control activities adequately support the achievement of financial reporting objectives, including whether we have appropriate change management, access provisioning, and program development controls in place. Please also evaluate whether our current policies clearly establish expectations and whether corresponding procedures effectively put those policies into action. Additionally, I'd like the assessment to cover how we obtain and use relevant, quality information to support internal control functioning, and whether our internal communication channels adequately convey control objectives and responsibilities to the right people. The deliverable should be a gap analysis report with remediation recommendations ranked by priority, and I'd like a draft ready for steering committee review by the end of next month. Please coordinate with the IT governance team and the business process owners to ensure comprehensive coverage.",
